<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JULY 18.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JULY 18.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates for leading currencies on Friday were as follows.</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     July 18     July 17   Dec 31 96    CHANGE</p>
<p>								 FROM YR-END</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  281.600     282.140     247.020   14.00 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  309.860     309.850     306.830    0.99 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  157.150     157.095     158.970   -1.14 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.552	46.514	47.182   -1.34 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  472.000     470.180     419.180   12.60 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  139.635     139.555     141.685   -1.45 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.159	16.170	16.185   -0.16 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  244.460     242.900     212.430   15.08 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.869	 1.867	 1.888   -1.01 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.559	 1.557	 1.581   -1.39 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  190.550     190.335     183.135    4.05 %</p>
<p>Note: The net change is calculated as the percentage difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December 31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
